mapping "SN499.1" source="SN499" target="18946005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source SN499 SNOMED CT 18946005 = sacral/caudal block, unspecified (caudal epidural anesthesia). No
        generic concept exists in the mirror; the caudal-specific concepts present are subtypes with
        qualifiers (e.g. 56659009, 67716003 therapeutic caudal epidural) that are narrower than the
        un-qualified source. Target, the parent that subsumes caudal/sacral epidural blocks. Broader:
        every sacral/caudal block is an epidural anesthesia. Moderate: legitimate ancestor but loses the
        caudal specificity (one level up); UNS source not independently crosswalk-verified.
        """
}
